  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n({10 - [ {frac{3)/(4) + left{ {4(1)/(2) - ( {(1)/(4) + (1)/({84)}} )} right}} ]}}{4} = ?\n\n**Concept used**\n\nBODMAS rule\n\n [IMAGE: https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/ZFoN-bAYshcZXA6Vkb6XBLuz3naCK2rCjL9VNMK5FBoQapzj_is-liVAq5wqRuaXx_QymC0xNQlXx7prnKQctl99GyCLVZRb4PniOSpj0WPQD11CQfzEtxz31CDKdXI4Y2NPzj1Xxxn5xaAeyPnKzvQ] \n\n**Calculations:**\n\n[10 - [(3/4) + {9/2 - (1/4 + 1/84)}]] ÷ 4\n\n⇒ [10 - [(3/4) + {9/2 - (21 + 1)/84}]] ÷ 4\n\n⇒ [10 - [(3/4) + {9/2 - (22/84)}]] ÷ 4\n\n⇒ [10 - [(3/4) + {9/2 - 11/42)}]] ÷ 4\n\n⇒ [10 - [(3/4) + {(189 - 11)/42}]] ÷ 4\n\n⇒ [10 - [(3/4) + {178/42}]] ÷ 4\n\n⇒ [10 - {(3/4) + 89/21}] ÷ 4\n\n⇒ [10 - {(63 + 356)/(21 × 4)}] ÷ 4\n\n⇒ [10 - (419/84)] ÷ 4\n\n⇒ [(840 - 419)/84)] ÷ 4\n\n⇒ [421/84] ÷ 4\n\n⇒ [421/336] \n\n⇒ 1frac{{85}}{{336}}\n\n**∴ The simplified value of the above equation is 1frac{{85}}{{336}}.**",
